    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Beef stew with dumplings is slow-braised chuck steak in a thick gravy with root vegetables, finished with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "suet",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "suet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dumplings that steam on the surface of the stew for the last 25 minutes. The dumplings come out soft and giving on the inside with a lightly set crust on top. Make the stew first and the dumplings later; they only need the final portion of the cooking time."
          }
        ]
      },
